                <note rend="inline" type="source">836.48 1930 Hurricane/16: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Minister in the Dominican Republic</hi> (<hi
                        rendition="#italic">Curtis</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of
                        State</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Santo Domingo</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1930-09-06T18:00:00-04:40">September 6, 1930—6
                        p.m.</date><lb/>[Received 6:50 p.m.]</dateline></opener>
                <p>99. My September 6, 5 p.m. Add name Barney Morgan to committee.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Curtis</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
